{"id":"Cd60f0c6ceac02c34f1c5","zh":"特征参数","en":"characteristic parameter","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","definition_zh":"用来表征不平顺或振动信号特性的统计量或提取量。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"Cd60f0c6ceac02c34f1c5","zh":"特征参数","en":"characteristic parameter","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","group_id":"H2fb9f1e465ce3c222b52","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道不平顺与信号处理 · 徐磊等（2014）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D6ddf9abf997935036d37","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"特征参数"},{"id":"D95f9a8b942e31909c762","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"characteristic parameter"}],"sources":{"P103":{"id":"P103","title":"轨道不平顺作用下铁路列车车体振动状态的PCA-SVM预测分析","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦","year":"2014","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8361.2014.07.003","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2014）","overview_slug":"2014-pca-svm-forecast-of-car-body-vibration-states-of-railway-locomotives-and-vehicles-under-the-action-o"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S7111b5f8c5aac9a35d10","source_id":"P103","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"对轨道检查车多次实地检测的数据采用PCA-SVM分类器计算的分析结果表明:绝对均值、方根均值、方根幅值等主要轨道不平顺统计参数控制车体的整体振动状态,其他特征参数起调节车体振动的作用;采用扭曲和水平不平顺作为预测模型的输入,可使车体振动状态的测算准确率达到90%以上。","citations":[{"source_id":"P103","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S39f6fa91c56f038392ef","source_id":"P103","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"在铁路养护维修领域,车体振动对行车舒适、安全性及轨道不平顺状态的辅助评价等有重要意义,采用动力模型进行车体振动状态预测时, 需要的仿真分析时耗较长,难以实现铁路线路养护维修领域的实时性要求,同时也难以获得对车体振动响应影响最大的轨道不平顺统计特征参数。","citations":[{"source_id":"P103","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C400c31c2498e694642f1","target_concept_id":"C400c31c2498e694642f1","target_zh":"水平不平顺","target_en":"cross-level irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C21672f3eade194acbf1b","target_concept_id":"C21672f3eade194acbf1b","target_zh":"车体振动","target_en":"car-body vibration","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_concept_id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_zh":"轨道不平顺","target_e